          human: "Draw one from the stock or discard. Meld sets (3â€“4 of a kind) or runs (3+ in suit). Lay off on any meld. Discard one to end your turn. First to get rid of all cards wins. Others count what's leftâ€”face cards 10, aces 1, numbers at face value.",
          ai: 'Game: Rummy. Progression: [Deal -> Draw -> Meld/lay off (optional) -> Discard -> next player | Score if out]. Draw 1 from stock or discard_top. Meld: sets (3â€“4 same rank) or runs (3+ consecutive same suit). Lay off on melds. Discard 1 to end turn. Go out = win. Losers sum deadwood (A=1, 2â€“10=face, J/Q/K=10).',
